: left;\" data-section-id=\"1nlecbm\" data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"96\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">1. SGPGI Nursing Officer &amp; Non Teaching Online Form Start Date?</span></span></strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"178\">The online application process started on <strong>18 June 2025.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"1e84k3r\" data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"474\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>2. SGPGI Nursing Officer &amp; Non Teaching Exam Date 2026 ?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"553\">The Examination will be conducted in <strong>19-23 June 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>3. Where can I find the syllabus for the SGPGI Nursing Officer &amp; Non Teaching Examination?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">The detailed syllabus and examination scheme for the SGPGI Nursing Officer &amp; Non Teaching Examination are available in the official notification. Candidates are advised to read the notification carefully for complete syllabus details.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>4. SGPGI Nursing Officer &amp; Non Teaching Notification PDF?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can download the notification through SarkariResult.com.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"kyy6a2\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"221\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>5. SGPGI Nursing Officer &amp; Non Teaching Recruitment 2025 Last Date?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to apply online is <strong>31 July 2025.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>6. What is the last date to Update application fee Details?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <b>31 July 2025</b></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>7. How can I apply for SGPGI Nursing Officer &amp; Non Teaching Exam?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong>.\n<p></p><figure id=\"attachment_22383\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-22383\" style=\"width: 1459px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-22383\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201469%20959'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"Indian Navy Agniveer Apprentices INET 02/2026\" width=\"1469\" height=\"959\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/navyagniveerinet022026.png 1469w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/navyagniveerinet022026-300x196.png 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/navyagniveerinet022026-1024x668.png 1024w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/navyagniveerinet022026-768x501.png 768w\" data-lazy-sizes=\"(max-width: 1469px) 100vw, 1469px\" data-lazy-src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/navyagniveerinet02202